<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Leslie lifts Dec qtr op income, output.</title>
<headline>Leslie lifts Dec qtr op income, output.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter to end-Dec versus preceding quarter</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Capital spending			  1.71 vs 2.95</p>
<p>    Gold output (kg)			 656.0 vs 638.0</p>
<p>    Tonnes milled/treated		118,000 vs 117,000</p>
<p>    Yield (gram/t)			     5.6 vs 5.5</p>
<p>    Cost (rand/kg)			  46,966 vs 47,408</p>
<p>    Revenue (rand/kg)		     56,007 vs 54,899</p>
<p>Full name: Leslie division of Evander Gold Mines Ltd, managed by Gencor Ltd.</p>
<p>NOTE - The company, which has merged with Kinross and Winkelhaak in Evander Gold Mines Ltd, reported an operating income of 6.35 million rand from the 4.86 in the previous quarter.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
